  "body": "From #whatwg on Freenode yesterday:\n\n> 1:34 PM <@frewsxcv> should element.setAttribute work with content attributes in addition to idl attributes\n> 11:47 PM <@annevk> frewsxcv: it only works on content attributes…\n\nBut, given this example:\n\n``` html\n<body></body>\n\n<script>\n// 'bgColor' is the IDL attribute, 'bgcolor' is the content attribute\ndocument.body.setAttribute('bgColor', 'green');\n</script>\n```\n\nThis results in the page turning green for me on Chrome, Firefox, and Safari.\n",
